{
  "name": "MaxVideoAI - Brief to approved generation",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "brief-template-guide",
      "name": "Template guide: brief to approved generation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -900,
        -1100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 900,
        "height": 620,
        "content": "# Turn a brief into an approved generation\n\n## Intended user and outcome\nFor producers and creative teams using self-hosted n8n, this template turns a structured creative brief into model recommendations, a project budget, an exact MaxVideoAI quote, one human-approved generation, and a recoverable library result.\n\n### How it works\n1. Brief Input receives `recommendationRequest`, `projectBudgetRequest`, and `generationRequest`.\n2. Deterministic MCP Client nodes list and recommend models, calculate the budget, and call `prepare_generation`.\n3. Human Approval pauses on the exact fresh quote. The workflow proceeds only when the POST body contains `approved: true` and the matching `quoteId`; rejection performs no generation.\n4. `confirm_generation` runs once. Bounded status recovery polls with the accepted `jobId`, then presents the completed result or leaves a timed-out job recoverable by that same ID. Recovery never loops back to confirmation.\n\n### Setup\nImport this disabled workflow into a self-hosted n8n instance. After import, create a MaxVideoAI MCP OAuth credential for `https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp`, complete OAuth in the owner-approved account, and attach that credential to every MCP Client node. Supply the three strict-schema request objects at Brief Input and test the read-only path before preparing a quote. Keep secrets and credential references out of exported JSON.\n\n## Approval and supported scope\nShow the exact current quote to a human and obtain explicit approval for that amount before resuming the webhook. A changed or expired quote requires a fresh prepare-and-approve cycle. This candidate covers the validated deterministic MCP Client path on self-hosted n8n only. n8n Cloud and AI Agent use through MCP Client Tool are explicitly unsupported by this template and are outside the public compatibility claim."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-prepare-note",
      "name": "Step 1: prepare a fresh quote",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -940,
        -230
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1300,
        "height": 500,
        "content": "## 1. Brief, models, budget and quote\n\nBrief Input feeds `recommend_models` and `calculate_project_budget`; `prepare_generation` returns a fresh exact quote without spending credits."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-approval-note",
      "name": "Step 2: require exact human approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        360,
        -230
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 500,
        "height": 500,
        "content": "## 2. Human approval is the spending gate\n\nHuman Approval pauses for a person to approve the exact quote. Only `approved: true` with the matching `quoteId` passes; rejection starts no generation."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-recovery-note",
      "name": "Step 3: confirm once and recover by job ID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        860,
        -230
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1300,
        "height": 520,
        "content": "## 3. One confirmation, bounded recovery\n\nAfter approval, `confirm_generation` runs once and returns `jobId`. Bounded recovery polls that job; a timeout preserves it and never repeats confirmation."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-trigger",
      "name": "Brief Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "position": [
        -900,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-normalize",
      "name": "Normalize Brief",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        -680,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "recommendation-request",
              "name": "recommendationRequest",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "={{ $json.recommendationRequest }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "budget-request",
              "name": "projectBudgetRequest",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "={{ $json.projectBudgetRequest }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "generation-request",
              "name": "generationRequest",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "={{ $json.generationRequest }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-models",
      "name": "List Models",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "position": [
        -460,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "tool": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "list_models"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ surface: $('Normalize Brief').item.json.recommendationRequest.surface || 'video' }) }}",
        "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp",
        "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api",
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-recommend",
      "name": "Recommend Models",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "position": [
        -240,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "tool": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "recommend_models"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify($('Normalize Brief').item.json.recommendationRequest) }}",
        "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp",
        "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api",
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-budget",
      "name": "Calculate Project Budget",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "position": [
        -20,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "tool": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "calculate_project_budget"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify($('Normalize Brief').item.json.projectBudgetRequest) }}",
        "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp",
        "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api",
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-prepare",
      "name": "Prepare Generation",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "position": [
        200,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "tool": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "prepare_generation"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify($('Normalize Brief').item.json.generationRequest) }}",
        "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp",
        "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api",
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-approval",
      "name": "Human Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "position": [
        420,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "unit": "days",
        "amount": 1,
        "resume": "webhook",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "approvalRule": "Approve the exact fresh MaxVideoAI quote only"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-approval-check",
      "name": "Require Explicit Approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        640,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "exact-approval",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body && $json.body.approved === true && $json.body.quoteId === $('Prepare Generation').item.json.structuredContent.quoteId }}",
              "rightValue": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-rejected",
      "name": "Approval Rejected",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "position": [
        860,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "outcome": "No generation was confirmed"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-confirm",
      "name": "Confirm Generation",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "position": [
        860,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "tool": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "confirm_generation"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ quoteId: $('Prepare Generation').item.json.structuredContent.quoteId, confirmed: true }) }}",
        "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp",
        "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api",
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-poll-wait",
      "name": "Wait Before Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "position": [
        1080,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "unit": "seconds",
        "amount": 15,
        "resume": "timeInterval"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-status",
      "name": "Get Generation Status",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "position": [
        1300,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "tool": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "get_generation_status"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ jobId: $('Confirm Generation').item.json.structuredContent.jobId }) }}",
        "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp",
        "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api",
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-terminal",
      "name": "Generation Terminal?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        1520,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "or",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "completed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.structuredContent.status }}",
              "rightValue": "completed"
            },
            {
              "id": "failed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.structuredContent.status }}",
              "rightValue": "failed"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-poll-limit",
      "name": "Continue Polling?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        1740,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "bounded-poll",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $runIndex < 19 }}",
              "rightValue": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-poll-timeout",
      "name": "Polling Timed Out",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "position": [
        1960,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "outcome": "Accepted job remains recoverable by jobId"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "brief-result",
      "name": "Present Result",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "position": [
        1740,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "tool": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "present_generation"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ jobId: $('Confirm Generation').item.json.structuredContent.jobId }) }}",
        "endpointUrl": "https://api.maxvideoai.com/mcp",
        "authentication": "mcpOAuth2Api",
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ],
